hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"126","Allāhumma innā najʿaluka fī nūḥūrihim, wa naʿūdhu bika min shurūrihim.. O Allah, we place You before them (as a shield), and we seek refuge in You from their evil."
"127","Allāhumma anta ʿaḍudī, wa anta naṣīrī, bika ajūlu wa bika aṣūlu wa bika uqātilu.. O Allah, You are my support, and You are my helper. With You I move, with You I attack, and with You I fight."
